Z||000035||DRH||08-27-2001||12:54 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 86seyellow:<BR><B><P>All the gas stations price fix in there area. I know in LAcrosse wiasonsin , they have a meeting on sat morning and lal the stations agree to one price. They say it isnt fixing but determining profits<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I live right outside of La Crosse. This is the <B>only</B> place I've ever lived where all stations are the same price. The no-name cost the same as Shell, Citgo, etc... From watching the signs change <B>daily</B> here lately, I think Kwik Trip sets their price and the rest follow. Kwik Trip must have well over half the pumps in town.<BR>||||reg||1
