Z||000040||86seyellow||08-27-2001||09:38 AM||||In LAcrosse WIsconsin they do have an agreement. THey allow Kwik Trip to post the prices first. Tghis keeps the profits where all the stations can make big money. When they all say they make .03 cents a gallon is bull. They profit over .25 cents a gallon. There was an inquiry about price fixing about 10 years ago. There was a station that kwik trip wanted to buy form a local guy for location, they offered him a price, he didnt like it and wanted more . TO get the price he wanted he stated he was going to call the feds and tell them all. Needless to say they gave him more than he wanted for his station to shut up.<BR>true story<BR><P>------------------<BR>if you saw a yellow streak go by you really fast it was a fiero<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieropix1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
