Z||000049||theogre||08-27-2001||07:59 PM||||Don't be blaming the oil people for all of it. <P>While you are jabbering about fuel prices, take a visit to <A HREF="http://www.api.org" TARGET=_blank>www.api.org</A>  and download the acrobat file that lists the state fuel tax.<BR>Add that number to the federal tax.... <P>Now add in whatever city and county tax you may have.... You'll be suprised just how much of that fuel dollar <I>isn't</I> going to the oil companies. Many states and the feds want to raise the taxes even more.<P>In DE it's 41.4 cents per gallon just in state and fed. I'm still trying to find out what the county and Wilmington add.||||reg||1
